tep in building an AJAX-like website, it is common for developers to start with a template, which contains HTML (or markup) that is compiled into a complete web page. This is called a HTML page template (or HtmlTemplate for short). The HtmlTemplate can be used as a base for", "depth": 2, "seed_id": 0, "token_count": 512}
